{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_any_unknown_never_void_any", "label": "any turns checking off", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/any-unknown-never-void.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Assignable to everything and from everything. Property access, call, and index all allowed and produce any. Spreads through inference with no error. Measured: two any lines produced zero diagnostics."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_any_unknown_never_void_unknown", "label": "unknown requires narrowing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/any-unknown-never-void.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Everything assignable to unknown; unknown assignable to nothing except unknown and any. TS18046 / TS2322 until you prove what it is."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_any_unknown_never_void_never", "label": "never empty type", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/any-unknown-never-void.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No value has it. Return type of functions that throw or loop; assignable to everything vacuously; result of narrowing everything away (exhaustiveness)."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_any_unknown_never_void_void", "label": "void means ignore the return", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/any-unknown-never-void.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not undefined and not never. A void function returns undefined at runtime; void says the value is not part of the contract."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_any_unknown_never_void_unknown_at_the_door", "label": "unknown at the door, never any", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/any-unknown-never-void.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Correct type for every input you did not create. fetch JSON as unknown then schema.parse. JSON.parse returns any \u2014 assign to unknown and validate."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_any_unknown_never_void_void_accepts_return", "label": "Functions returning values assign to void", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/any-unknown-never-void.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A function returning something is assignable to () => void. Lets forEach(x => list.push(x)) compile. Trap: useEffect(() => fetchData()) returns a Promise as cleanup."}], "edges": [{"source": "build_css_p2_docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_any_unknown_never_void_unknown_at_the_door", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_any_unknown_never_void_unknown", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/any-unknown-never-void.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "build_css_p2_docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_any_unknown_never_void_unknown_at_the_door", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_any_unknown_never_void_any", "relation": "rationale_for", "confiden